        "explanation": "<p>We need to multiply a two-digit number by a two-digit number: <svg width=\"137.821\" height=\"12.5\" viewBox=\"344.139 271.146 103.366 9.375\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M -0.0010625 -0.0005625 L 40.3505 -0.0005625\" transform=\"matrix(1,0,0,-1,402.337,279.601)\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\".996\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" /><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"343.764\" fill=\"#e132a2\">7</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"350.422\" fill=\"#109e24\">5</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"360.068\">×</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"371.866\" fill=\"#e132a2\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"378.524\" fill=\"#109e24\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"388.917\">=</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"444.927\">.</text></g></svg></p><p>First, calculate the partial products by decomposing into tens and ones.</p><p>We can show this with an area model.</p><div class=\"h-scroll\"><img class=\"displayed-image\" src=\"959141276942.01.svg\" /></div><p>Then, add the partial products together: <svg width=\"236.479\" height=\"12.688\" viewBox=\"307.133 271.115 177.359 9.516\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"306.774\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"315.664\">8</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"322.322\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"328.979\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"338.623\">+</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"351.305\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"357.963\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"364.621\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"374.264\">+</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"386.933\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"393.591\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"400.248\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"409.892\">+</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"422.575\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"429.232\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"439.615\">=</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"453.038\">3</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"461.942\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"468.599\">5</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"475.257\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"481.914\">.</text></g></svg></p><p>Therefore, <svg width=\"119.518\" height=\"12.5\" viewBox=\"350.999 271.146 89.639 9.375\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"350.624\">7</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"357.282\">5</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"366.925\">×</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"378.72\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"385.378\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"395.774\">=</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"409.183\">3</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"418.087\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"424.745\">5</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"431.402\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"438.06\">.</text></g></svg></p>"
